										<div class="mes-evento">
											<h3>July 2026</h3>
										</div>
									
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IAEE-eng-chi-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>47th IAEE International Conference 2026</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 19-07-2026 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Santiago, Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is a sponsor of the 47th IAEE International Conference 2026 – Santiago, Chile, held under the theme “Bridging Continents, Fueling Progress: Energy Development in a Global Context.” This event will bring together the global energy economics community in Santiago, marking the second time this prestigious conference takes place in South America. In a context [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/47th-iaee-international-conference-2026/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																																<div class="bloque-eventos">

										<div class="mes-evento">
											<h3>June 2026</h3>
										</div>
									
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/exponor-2026-eng-chi-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>EXPONOR 2026</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 08-06-2026 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Antofagasta-Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://exponor.cl/" target="_blank">https://exponor.cl/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>EXPONOR 2026, under the theme ‘Innovative Solutions for Sustainable Industries,’ positions itself as a key exhibition for the development of the productive sector, promoting investment, job creation, and the implementation of advanced technologies. This event, taking place from June 8 to 11, 2026, in Antofagasta, Chile, showcases the latest advancements aimed at the mining and [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/exponor-2026/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																																<div class="bloque-eventos">

										<div class="mes-evento">
											<h3>April 2026</h3>
										</div>
									
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/andean-eng-chi-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Andean Bridge 26&#8242;</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 22-04-2026 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Mendoza, Argentina</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.in-vr.co/andean-bridge" target="_blank">https://www.in-vr.co/andean-bridge</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is sponsoring the event “Andean Bridge 2026,” which will take place from April 22 to 24 in Mendoza, Argentina. Andean Bridge is a long-term initiative co-founded by IN-VR, the Toronto Stock Exchange (TSX), BYMA, the Mendoza Stock Exchange (BCM), and the Government of Mendoza, aimed at mobilizing local capital and building a bridge between [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/andean-bridge-26/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																																<div class="bloque-eventos">

										<div class="mes-evento">
											<h3>March 2026</h3>
										</div>
									
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/RE-eng-cgi-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>RE+ CONO SUR</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 25-03-2026 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Santiago, Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://re-plus.events/es/cono-sur/" target="_blank">https://re-plus.events/es/cono-sur/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile sponsors RE+ Cono Sur, an event organized by RE+ Events and Fundación Recyclápolis, to be held on March 25–26 at the Centro Cultural Mapocho in Santiago, Chile. RE+ Cono Sur is an international trade fair focused on the fast-growing markets of the Southern Cone in solar energy, energy storage, and electric mobility. Over the [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/re-cono-sur/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																							
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/acades-26-eng-chi-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>ACADES 2026</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 18-03-2026 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Metropolitan Santiago Convention & Event Center</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.congresoacades.cl/" target="_blank">https://www.congresoacades.cl/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is a sponsor of the second ACADES International Congress 2026: Water for Growth, which will take place on March 18 and 19 at the Metropolitan Santiago Event Center in Chile. ACADES aims to drive climate change adaptation through the production, treatment, and distribution of water across all watersheds in the various regions of the [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/acades-2026/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																																<div class="bloque-eventos">

										<div class="mes-evento">
											<h3>January 2026</h3>
										</div>
									
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/norway-eng-chi-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>“Doing Business in Chile: Strategic Insights for  Norwegian Companies</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 21-01-2026 10:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual Event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile sponsors the webinar “Doing Business in Chile: Strategic Insights for Norwegian Companies,” which will present a report by Menon Economics on the opportunities, challenges, and market conditions for Norwegian companies in Chile, along with an overview of the trade relationship between both countries. The purpose of this event is to facilitate the entry of [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/doing-business-in-chile-strategic-insights-for-norwegian-companies/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																							
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Ingles_Chica-427x313.png" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>InvestChile Seminar 2026</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 14-01-2026 8:30 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Santiago, Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://seminar.investchile.gob.cl/en/" target="_blank">https://seminar.investchile.gob.cl/en/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is organizing the second edition of the “InvestChile Seminar”, an international event to be held in person with a live broadcast. Its objective is to foster dialogue on global economic outlooks and the strategies needed to promote a renewed investment climate in Latin America. The event will bring together government authorities, global companies, and experts to [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/investchile-seminar-2026-2/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																																<div class="bloque-eventos">

										<div class="mes-evento">
											<h3>December 2025</h3>
										</div>
									
