											<p>InvestChile is organizing the workshop “Challenges and Investment and Financing Opportunities in Chile’s Agri-Food Sector,” an event aimed at promoting dialogue and collaboration among national and international stakeholders in the agri-food industry, to be held on Thursday, November 13. The workshop is targeted at AgroTech companies and startups, both Chilean and foreign, that develop technological [&hellip;]</p>

