											<p>The Regional Government of Biobío, in partnership with the Embassy of Norway, the Embassy of Denmark, the Regional Corporation Desarrolla Biobío, and InvestChile, is organizing the event “Offshore Wind Energy: An Opportunity for a Just Transition and Economic Growth for the Biobío Region.” The event aims to showcase the Nordic experience in developing the offshore [&hellip;]</p>

