											</div>
											<p>InvestChile, McCarthy Tétrault, the Canadian Trade Commissioner Service, and the Consulate General of Chile in Vancouver are organizing an exclusive investment briefing on Chile&#8217;s Infrastructure Market Opportunities, Port Infrastructure Development and Modernization Plans, to be held on Thursday, November 6th, from 08:30 to 10:30 AM, in Vancouver, Canada. A representative from InvestChile will share insights [&hellip;]</p>

