											</div>
											<p>InvestChile and the Canadian Trade Commissioner Service are organizing an exclusive infrastructure and public-private partnership (PPP) investment briefing focused on Chile’s robust infrastructure pipeline and upcoming concession opportunities, The event will take place on Monday, November 3, from 8:30 to 10:30 a.m. (Eastern Time), in Toronto, Canada This session will feature Senior Officials from the [&hellip;]</p>

