											<p>The Embassy of Chile in the Republic of Korea and the Korea International Trade Association (KITA) are organizing the Chile–Korea Investment Dialogue: Strengthening Opportunities for Sustainable Investment, to be held on October 30, 2025, on the occasion of the State Visit by H.E Gabriel Boric, President of the Republic of Chile. This high-level forum will [&hellip;]</p>

