											<p>The Chilean Ministry of Energy is organizing the International Seminar “Building Resilient Energy Policies in Asia-Pacific”, which will take place on October 27 and 28 at the Multipurpose Hall of the Office of the Comptroller General of the Republic (Teatinos 56, Santiago). Over two days, representatives from governments, international organizations, academia, and experts will discuss [&hellip;]</p>

