											<p>As part of H.E. President of the Republic of Chile Gabriel Boric&#8217;s visit to Italy, the Embassy of Chile and Foreign Investment Promotion Agency &#8211; InvestChile – are organizing the Chile–Italy Business Conference, which will take place on Wednesday, October 15th, at 2:30 p.m. On this occasion, Karla Flores, Director of InvestChile, and Francisca Muller, [&hellip;]</p>

