											<p>The Embassy of Switzerland in Chile and the Swiss-Chilean Chamber of Commerce are organizing the first Swiss Innovation Week, to be held from October 14 to 17, 2025. As part of this event, a conference will take place on October 14 and 15, aiming to strengthen ties between the Swiss and Chilean innovation ecosystems and [&hellip;]</p>

