											<p>InvestChile is a sponsor of the fourth edition of the Energy Storage Summit Latin America, which will take place on October 14 and 15 in Santiago, Chile. The Summit has become a key meeting point for independent power producers (IPPs) and developers, investors, financial institutions and banks, utilities, consulting firms, software providers, and manufacturers who [&hellip;]</p>

