											<p>Talento Digital para Chile and InvestChile are organizing the &#8216;Talento Digital fair&#8217; (FLV) 2025, which will take place from Monday, October 13 to Friday, October 17. As in previous editions, this virtual fair will provide companies with access to a platform featuring four pavilions, where they can post their job opportunities for digital talent. The [&hellip;]</p>

