											</div>
											<p>The nearshore services industry in Latin America and the Caribbean is facing a new geopolitical landscape, marked by the policies of the Trump administration and a realignment of trade relations with the United States. In this context, InvestChile will participate in Nexus 2025, a key event that will bring together more than 1,200 high-level executives [&hellip;]</p>

