											<p>InvestChile is a sponsor of Chile&#8217;s most important food industry trade fair, Espacio Food &amp; Service. The event, which will take place on September 30, October 1, and 2, 2025, will mark its 13th edition and will be held at the Espacio Riesco Event and Convention Center. It serves as the key gathering where the [&hellip;]</p>

