											<p>InvestChile will take part in the “Floating Offshore Wind Farms Development in APEC Economies” seminar, organized by Chile’s Ministry of Energy in collaboration with the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) forum. The event will be held on Thursday, July 24 and Friday, July 25, 2025, starting at 9:00 AM in Santiago, Chile. On this occasion, Mauricio [&hellip;]</p>

