											<p>InvestChile will take part in Smart City Expo Santiago 2025, to be held from July 24 to 26 at the Centro Cultural Estación Mapocho in Santiago, Chile. The event, created in partnership with Fira Barcelona —organizer of the world’s leading smart cities event, Smart City Expo World Congress— will bring together experts from a wide [&hellip;]</p>

