											<p>The Director of InvestChile, Karla Flores Mardones, will present the ninth Public Account of the Foreign Investment Promotion Agency on Tuesday, June 24 at 9:00 a.m. On this occasion, the main achievements and results of the institution during 2024 will be presented, along with the challenges for the current period.</p>

