											</div>
											<p>Offshore wind, organized by Renewable UK, is a crucial part of the UK Government’s “missions” for the energy sector and economic growth, but also for development around the world. This year, the conference will focus on the urgent actions needed to reach UK and global offshore wind deployment goals for 2030.With keynotes planned from prominent [&hellip;]</p>

