												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Concepción, Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The MERIC Center, in collaboration with the H2V Biobío Program, the Faculty of Business Sciences of the University of Biobío, and with the support of Corfo Biobío, is organizing this regional forum aimed at opening a space for dialogue on the development of offshore wind energy in the Biobío region. The event seeks to gather [&hellip;]</p>

