											<p>As part of the Raw Materials Summit 2025, to be held in Brussels this coming May, the Chilean delegation—comprising InvestChile, Cochilco, Enami, and Codelco, and led by the Minister of Mining, Aurora Williams—will host the workshop ‘Critical Minerals in Chile: Public Policy Perspectives and Copper and Lithium Projects’.  This session aims to explore Chile’s business [&hellip;]</p>

