											<p>InvestChile is a sponsor of EXPOMIN 2025, the largest mining trade fair in Latin America, which will take place from April 22 to 25 at the Espacio Riesco Convention and Event Center. The fair has established itself as a platform that promotes the transfer of knowledge, experiences, and especially the offering of technologies that contribute [&hellip;]</p>

