											<p>As part of the 2025 Presidential Tour to Brazil, InvestChile will participate in a business meeting on April 22, as well as in a prominent event focused on business opportunities related to the Bioceanic Corridor, to be held on April 23 in Brasília. The event will be attended by the President of the Republic, Gabriel [&hellip;]</p>

