											<p>InvestChile is a sponsor of the Italian Agri-Business Mission to Chile: Innovation and Sustainability for the Future of Agriculture, which will take place on March 17, 2025, in Santiago, Chile. The event is part of the Chilean-European Alliance for the Green Transition in Chilean Fruit MSMEs and Their Business Organizations project and will feature the [&hellip;]</p>

