											<p>Confindustria, the Italian Trade Agency (ITA), and the Embassy of Italy in Chile, in collaboration with InvestChile and the Inter-American Development Bank (IDB), are organizing the webinar &#8220;Business Mission to Chile&#8221;. This event will present activities related to the International Investment Forum &#8211; Punta Arenas 2025 and the IDB Annual Meeting (Santiago, March 26-30). It [&hellip;]</p>

