											</div>
											<p>The Director of InvestChile, Karla Flores, will participate in the Chile-Norway Business Meeting, to be held on November 26, 2024. Around 60 Norwegian companies have presence in Chile, representing various sectors. Chile is Norway’s second largest marked in Latin-America, after Brazil. The upcoming event seeks to address opportunities and challenges for Norwegian-Chilian partnerships and to [&hellip;]</p>

