											</div>
											<p>On November 25, the Virtual Job Fair organized by Talento Digital para Chile of Fundación Chile, in collaboration with InvestChile, will kick off. This event is designed to connect companies with highly skilled talent trained through IT bootcamps. This fair is an excellent opportunity for companies seeking qualified talent at both entry-level and specialized roles [&hellip;]</p>

