											</div>
											<p>The Committee of Ministers for Foreign Investment – made up of Minister of Economy Nicolás Grau,  Undersecretary of Mining Suina Chahuán ,  Undersecretary for International Economic Relations Claudia Sanhueza, Minister of Public Works Jessica López, and InvestChile Executive Director Karla Flores – will meet on Thursday, November 21, to discuss the state of foreign direct [&hellip;]</p>

