											<p>Roundtable Discussion: Environmental Impact Assessment in Chile: Creating Opportunities &amp; Certainties for Investment Projects The Foreign Investment Promotion Agency – InvestChile and the Environmental Assessment Service – SEA invite you to the roundtable discussion, &#8220;Environmental Impact Assessment in Chile: Creating Opportunities &amp; Certainties for Investment Projects,&#8221; on Wednesday, November 13, at 2:45 p.m. The aim of this meeting is [&hellip;]</p>

