											</div>
											<p>The InvestChile Europe Roadshow 2024 is part of InvestChile&#8217;s international agenda to promote and attract investments in priority markets. This tour will take place in Rome, Genoa, Paris, and Madrid from October 29 to November 9, 2024. InvestChile&#8217;s Director, Karla Flores, leads this investment Roadshow, accompanied by Alejandro Riquelme, Head of the Strategic Development Unit [&hellip;]</p>

