											</div>
											<p>InvestChile will participate in the IMARC (International Mining and Resources Conference) in Sydney, Australia from the 28th to 30th of October, as part of the offical Chile delegation led by the Deputy Minister of Mining, Mrs. Suina Chahuán Kim. The delegation will present an overview of the Chile mining sector and investment opportunites in a seminar and [&hellip;]</p>

