											</div>
											<p>InvestChile participates in the forum &#8216;Chile &#8211; France: A Future Together,&#8217; an event organized by the Chilean-French Chamber for its members, aimed at analyzing future challenges in strategic sectors for both countries. The event will take place on October 18, a month that marks the 140th anniversary of the bilateral relationship between Chile and France. [&hellip;]</p>

