											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is organizing the roundtable &#8216;Competitiveness of the Software Industry in Chile: Where We Stand and What&#8217;s Next?&#8217; where representatives from foreign IT companies established in the country will participate to discuss projections, growth opportunities, and challenges to accelerate reinvestment in the sector. Topics such as access to digital talent, legal and labor framework, government [&hellip;]</p>

