											</div>
											<p>The Chilean-Canadian Chamber of Commerce, together with InvestChile – the Foreign Investment Promotion Agency – are organizing a business meeting that will feature a presentation by the Director of InvestChile, Karla Flores. The presentation will highlight the main strategic focuses, relations with Canada, and potential areas for future Canadian investment attraction in the country. The [&hellip;]</p>

