											<p>InvestChile will attend the IDC Artificial Intelligence and Cloud 2.0 Chile 2024, organized by IDC, one of the world&#8217;s leading technology consultancies, to listen to expert presentations and establish contacts with potential partners and foreign investors. Generative Artificial Intelligence (Generative AI) is revolutionizing the business landscape in Latin America, opening up a world of possibilities [&hellip;]</p>

