											<p>InvestChile Investment Promotion Executive and Energy Expert, Juan Pablo Purcell, will participate in the webinar &#8220;UK Export Finance: Financial Support Initiatives for Chile &amp; UK in the Energy Sector&#8221; on Wednesday, May 29, at 10:00 hrs (-4 GMT). This free event is organized by the Trade Department of the British Embassy, in collaboration with UKEF [&hellip;]</p>

