											<p>The Mission for Innovation in Port Management and Development aims to gather information on experiences and best practices that may be valuable to Chilean companies. The port sector is essential to the country’s economy, and as such the implementation of continuous improvements to increase productivity is a key factor in making Chile more competitive globally. [&hellip;]</p>

