											<p>InvestChile is sponsoring this event. Dating back over four decades, the International Air and Space Fair (FIDAE) is Latin America’s oldest and most widely recognized aerospace, defense and security exhibition. Chile’s show will be a multi-sectorial event covering the following areas: Civil and Commercial Aviation, Defense, Airport Equipment and Services, Homeland Security, Aircraft Maintenance and [&hellip;]</p>

