												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://cicmex.cl/" target="_blank">https://cicmex.cl/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile Director, Karla Flores, will participate in a meeting of members in the Chilean-Mexican Chamber of Commerce (CICMEX), where she will give a presentation to the Mexican companies invited on the FDI outlook in Chile. The event will take place in Santiago, Chile on March 20, 2024. *Closed event</p>

