											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 06-03-2024 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Santiago, Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://camacoes.cl/" target="_blank">https://camacoes.cl/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile Director, Karla Flores, will participate as a panelist in the Country Agenda Forum organized by the Official Spanish Chamber of Commerce in Chile (CAMACOES). This event will be held in Santiago, Chile on March 6, and will include a presentation on global foreign direct investment trends in 2023 and challenges for 2024. *Closed event</p>

