											<p>InvestChile Director Karla Flores and Investment Promotion Executive Christoff Janse, along with other government officials and representatives from Chilean businesses in the mining sector are to take part in an event to launch Chile’s trade mission to the National Prospectors and Developers Association of Canada (PDAC) convention, organized by ProChile.  This event will take place [&hellip;]</p>

