											<p>The Santiago de Chile Public Transport System is taking a new step in its modernization plan, through a request for proposals for the Road Use Concession 2023, which will incorporate more than 1,200 new electric buses, impacting 30% of the services provided in Chile’s capital city. The key characteristics of this tender include the fact [&hellip;]</p>

