												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>On December 15, the 16th edition of the “Investing for Sustainable Development” Report by the OECD Development Center, ECLAC, CAF and the European Commission will be launched in Santiago, Chile. The report proposes ways to promote investment aimed at more sustainable development by coordinating action by the public sector, private sector and international partners. Each [&hellip;]</p>

