												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Aysén-Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://goo.su/yg7v" target="_blank">https://goo.su/yg7v</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The Regional Government of Chile’s Aysén Region and economic development agency CORFO Regional Department will present the “Regional Value Proposition” as part of the “Investments for the development of Aysén” event. This activity will take place on December 12 at 10:00 in Coyhaique, with the attendance and participation of Chilean investment funds and companies in [&hellip;]</p>

