											</div>
											<p>The event, organized by Chile’s Tourism Undersecretary, will bring together several government entities and key investment and investment promotion players within and outside Latin America. It will also be an opportunity to learn about and analyze the current green investment scenario, thus outlining the future and perspectives from the tourism sector. InvestChile Director Karla Flores [&hellip;]</p>

