										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Research into the investment promotion opportunities: Los Ríos Region</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 04-12-2023 3:30 pm</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Valdivia, Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The Los Ríos Regional Government and the Corporación Regional de Desarrollo Productivo (CRDP) are organizing an activity in which there will be a presentation on the outcomes and conclusions from the research into “the investment promotion opportunities in the Los Ríos Region: regional value proposition stage”. The event will take place in the city of [&hellip;]</p>

