											<p>Organized by the Tarapacá Regional Government and the Tarapacá Development Corporation, the event will take place in Iquique from Tuesday, November 28 to Thursday, November 30. The forum aims to foster the connection between Latin America and the Asia-Pacific region. A Business Roundtable on Wednesday, November 29, will facilitate meetings and connections while providing an [&hellip;]</p>

