											</div>
											<p>The Inter-American Development Bank, in collaboration with InvestChile and Chile’s Finance Ministry, is organizing a round of Regional Workshops on Regional Value Chains in Latin America and the Caribbean, presenting the results of a study conducted on each region. The results for the Tarapacá Region will be presented at an event on Monday, November 20 [&hellip;]</p>

