											</div>
											<p>The Chamber of Pharmaceutical Innovation (CIF Chile), comprised of Chile&#8217;s innovation laboratories, will convene authorities, academia, civil society, health organizations, other players in the health ecosystem, and the scientific community, at this year’s annual industry meeting to reflect on the challenges ahead. These include contributing to transparency, bringing science closer to the community, promoting innovation [&hellip;]</p>

