											<p>Bess &amp; Les Chile, organized by The Voice of Renewables, is a face-to-face event focused on developing short (BESS) and long (LES) duration energy storage projects and technologies. Through panels and presentations by domestic and international companies, the event aims to promote the use of these technologies in Chile as one solution to the energy [&hellip;]</p>

