											<p>The third international innovation, entrepreneurship, and investment summit, EtMday Santiago 2023, organized by Corporación Emprende tu Mente, will be held from November 16 to 17, 2023, at Parque Bicentenario, Vitacura. The goal of this initiative is to connect unlikely peers from all over Chile and Latin America—entrepreneurs with large companies, investors, and mentors—in the pursuit [&hellip;]</p>

