											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 15-11-2023 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual Event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://goo.su/PrwCMYB" target="_blank">https://goo.su/PrwCMYB</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Submitted to Congress in 2022, the “More Women on Boards” bill aims to gradually increase female participation on the boards of directors of publicly traded and special companies. In that context, InvestChile and Chile’s Economy, Development and Tourism Ministry invite you to participate in The More Women on Boards of Directors Bill: Scope and Key [&hellip;]</p>

