											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/231031-InvestChile-Eventos-web_1.2-Ingles-427x313.png" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Developing Green Hydrogen and its Derivatives in Deserts Worldwide</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 07-11-2023 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://goo.su/cDLh2" target="_blank">https://goo.su/cDLh2</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>With support from InvestChile, H2 Antofagasta, MENA H2 Alliance and Dii Desert Energy are organizing a webinar entitled “Developing Green Hydrogen and its Derivatives in Deserts Worldwide.” The event will compare regional experiences and the latest trends in renewable hydrogen projects and identify regional best practices and synergies, providing valuable information for the players and [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/developing-green-hydrogen-and-its-derivatives-in-deserts-worldwide/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
