										</div>
									
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/231025_InvestChile_Evento-Web_Espanol_427x313-02-427x313.png" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
