											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 27-10-2023 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Rome, Italy</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>On October 27, Proa Latam will hold the first “Latin America Day in Milan to promote economic and trade relations between Italy and Latin America. The event is for companies seeking to learn more about and strengthen their positions in LatAm markets. InvestChile Investment Commissioner Italy Francisca Muller will participate as a panelist. &nbsp;</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/latin-america-day/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
