									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/prev-egenda-427x313ENG-427x313.png" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Chile LAC 2023 &#8211; 5th Green Hydrogen Summit</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 25-10-2023 8:30 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Centro Parque - 5330 Presidente Riesco Ave., Las Condes. </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.greenh2summitchilelac.cl/" target="_blank">https://www.greenh2summitchilelac.cl/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The fifth edition of the Green Hydrogen Summit – Chile LAC 2023 will be the largest/biggest open access renewable hydrogen event in the region. This Summit, of which InvestChile is a sponsor, will reunite authorities and representatives of both the public and private sectors, who will analyze the advancements and challenges of the new hydrogen [&hellip;]</p>

