											<p>1° Congress and international exhibition of the Chilean agroindustry &amp; technologies (CFIAgrotech) will be the event that brings together in one place the Chilean agri-food industry with national and international actors for the promotion, marketing, relationship and strengthening of the industry in the country and throughout its chain. InvestChile will be participating as a sponsor [&hellip;]</p>

