											<p>From October 22–27, the Dutch H2 Trade Mission to Chile will take place, whose main focus is on hydrogen production and related infrastructure. The scheduled activities include visits to public and private companies, together with authorities. The mission will then participate in the Green Hydrogen Summit organized by Chilean economic development agency CORFO and German [&hellip;]</p>

