											<p>This Roadshow is part of InvestChile’s international agenda for promoting and attracting investment in priority markets. It comprises business activities in Tokio and Seoul from Monday 9 of October to Friday 13th.   The Minister of Economy, Development and Tourism, Nicolás Grau Veloso and the InvestChile Director, Karla Flores, will lead this business mission in Japan [&hellip;]</p>

