											</div>
											<p>As part of the InvestChileTalks cycle, the Foreign Investment Promotion Agency &#8211; InvestChile together with Corfo, invite to the event &#8220;R&amp;D Law: Tax Incentive for IT companies&#8221;. The participants will learn about the benefits of the Chilean R&amp;D Law for foreign tech companies, as well as key aspects for a successful application. The R&amp;D Law [&hellip;]</p>

