											</div>
											<p>The event, which is held each year at the Espacio Riesco Convention and Event Center, is considered the most important in the Chilean food industry and a benchmark in Latin America. Espacio Food &amp; Service is an international trade fair that brings together over 22,000 people each year. The participants come together to observe the [&hellip;]</p>

