											<p>Expo Mercado Público is the most important event for government suppliers in Chile. In its fifth edition, it will bring together more than 1,000 companies that supply goods and services to the Public Sector, as well as more than 500 public buyers from all levels of government. During the two days of event, suppliers will [&hellip;]</p>

