										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Chile&#8217;s Lithium strategy &#038; business opportunities</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 24-08-2023 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Online</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://tools.investchile.gob.cl/en/webinar-chile-lithium-strategy" target="_blank">https://tools.investchile.gob.cl/en/webinar-chile-lithium-strategy</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile, the Foreign Investment Promotion Agency, presents an e-dialogue with the Minister of Economy of Chile, Nicolás Grau, to present the details of the recently announced National Lithium Strategy.   The event will take place on August 24th at 09:00h Chilean time.</p>

