											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is a sponsor of the XVII Annual Conference, &#8216;Chile: The Future from an Investment Perspective&#8217;, which will be held on Wednesday, August 9th in Santiago, Chile. On this occasion, InvestChile&#8217;s Director, Karla Flores will participate as moderator of the Foreign Investment panel. The activity will be attended by various public authorities such as the [&hellip;]</p>

