											<p>As part of the enactment of the 40-hour Law in Chile, the Foreign Investment Promotion Agency &#8211; InvestChile and the Ministry of Labor invite you to the webinar &#8220;Chile: 40-Hour Law for Sustainable Productive Development.&#8221; The meeting aims to review the key aspects of the implementation of the 40-hour Law in Chile, with a focus [&hellip;]</p>

