											<p>This Roadshow is part of InvestChile&#8217;s international agenda for promoting anda attracting investment in priority markets. It comprises business activities in various European Cities-such as Milan, Madrid, Berlin, Paris-, from 11 to the 21 of July. The Minister of Economy, Development and Tourism, Nicolás Grau Veloso will lead this Business mission in Berlin and Paris, [&hellip;]</p>

