											</div>
											<p>The Measure What Matters Program (Mide lo que Importa, MQI), carried out in partnership with Sistema B, has had two previous versions, one in 2020 and another in 2022. It supports a group of companies in measuring and visualizing improvements in the areas of community, environment, governance, clients, workers and business model. In order to [&hellip;]</p>

