											</div>
											<p>Visit of a delegation of Brazilian technology companies linked to Softex between 12 and 16 June. Softex has been working for 25 years to foster the Brazilian digital transformation, creating, promoting and implementing initiatives at national and international level in the areas of technology and innovation. Based in Brasilia/DF and Manaus/AM, it has 6 Areas, [&hellip;]</p>

