											</div>
											<p>The “Conference for the Promotion of Beijing – Chile Economic and Trade Cooperation” will be held on June 8, 2023 in Santiago. The conference aims to deepen exchange and collaboration in the industrial and commercial sectors between Beijing and Chile, and boost international trade and investment between Beijing and Latin America. It is being organized [&hellip;]</p>

