											</div>
											<p>As part of the Global Public Transport Summit, to be held in Barcelona between June 4 and 7, the Metropolitan Public Transport Department (DTPM) and InvestChile will present new public tenders worth USD 4 billion for the Metropolitan Region. In this context, the DTPM has organized a side event called “The Opportunity of Investment: Santiago [&hellip;]</p>

