											</div>
											<p>‘We Innovate: Mission to Spain 2023’ is the second international mission organized by CAMACOES. It aims to learn about experiences and good corporate practices that may be of value to our partners in Chile. This activity will take place between May 29 and June 2. Its main goal is to understand the profound changes arising [&hellip;]</p>

