											<p>The Asociación Industrial de Laboratorios Farmacéuticos A.G. (Industrial Association of Pharmaceutical Laboratories, ASILFA) is a trade association with 36 years of history at the service of the community, which focuses its efforts on providing products of the highest quality, produced under technological standards in accordance with the most demanding international parameters. The association is organizing [&hellip;]</p>

