											<p>InvestChile, Chile’s Foreign Investment Promotion Agency, is organizing a training event for the regional government teams in charge of foreign direct investment. The activity will address key issues for promoting and attracting foreign direct investment (FDI) at the local level, including the need for a competitive value offer and the design of effective services and/or [&hellip;]</p>

