											<p>The Chile Fintech Forum, organized by FinteChile, is Chile’s most important financial technology event. The event will include +50 panelists, +30 stands and +1,000 attendees, as well as networking, business rounds and much more. InvestChile’s Executive Director, Karla Flores, will be taking part in the opening of the event, inviting foreign companies from the sector [&hellip;]</p>

