											</div>
											<p>As part of the Chile Fintech Forum 2023, InvestChile, Chile’s Foreign Investment Promotion Agency, and FinteChile will be holding the workshop Fintech Law in Chile: Perspectives and Opportunities. The event will be headed by Economy, Development and Tourism Minister Nicolás Grau. Its goal is to connect the industry’s main public stakeholders with fintech companies participating [&hellip;]</p>

