										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>InvestChile-Ñuble Collaboration Agreement</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 08-05-2023 11:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Ñuble, Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile Director, Karla Flores, and the Regional Governor of #Ñuble, Oscar Crisóstomo, signed a collaboration agreement  in order to consolidate the coordinated efforts between the agency and the Regional Government of Ñuble to promote #ForeignInvestment The signing was also atended by InvestChile’s Head of Strategic Development Unit Alejandro Riquelme.</p>

