											</div>
											<p>The Digital Talent job fair will take place virtually between May 8 and 12. It will feature various companies that will publish their job offers to find the best IT digital talent profiles for Chile. On May 8, a conference will also be held in which the executive director of InvestChile, Karla Flores, will speak. [&hellip;]</p>

