											<h4>Land2land Connect 2023</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 04-05-2023 10:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual Event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The Land2land Connect 2023 digital event is an initiative promoted by the National Association of Innovative Business Promotion Entities (ANPROTEC), the Brazilian Micro and Small Business Support Service (SEBRAE), the Brazilian Trade and Investment Promotion Agency (APEXBrasil), the Brazilian Foreign Affairs Ministry Innovation Diplomacy Program (MRE) and the Brazilian Embassy in Chile. The webinar seeks [&hellip;]</p>

