										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Opportunities and Challenges for Developing Renewable H2 Projects in Chile</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 03-05-2023 11:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual Event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://bit.ly/43FxVTF" target="_blank">https://bit.ly/43FxVTF</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Webinar organized by Ata Insights in coordination with InvestChile as part of the free online events in preparation for RENMAD 2023 in Chile. The aim of this webinar is to show what coordinated public sector efforts and incentives are being made to facilitate and accelerate the development of the green hydrogen industry and its derivatives. [&hellip;]</p>

