											<p>The Committee of Ministers for Foreign Investment – made up of Economy Minister Nicolás Grau, Treasury Minister Mario Marcel; Energy Minister Diego Pardow; and Mining Minister Marcela Hernando; in addition to International Economic Relations Undersecretary Claudia Sanhueza; Public Works Undersecretary José Andrés Herrera; Agriculture Undersecretary Ignacia Fernández; and InvestChile Executive Director Karla Flores – will [&hellip;]</p>

