											<p>Our executive director, Karla Flores, will participate in the new edition of Gobierno Informa (Government Informs), which will focus on the new National Lithium Strategy. Mining Minister Marcela Hernando, Economy Minister Nicolás Grau and CORFO Executive Vice President José Miguel Benavente will also be participating.</p>

