											<p>The Knauf AQUAPANEL® factory in Chile will cover South America’s requirements for AQUAPANEL® Cement Boards, which are the main product in this innovative technology. The plant will also provide new opportunities for professional development, and the creation of direct employment in Puente Alto and indirect employment throughout the South American region related to architecture, construction [&hellip;]</p>

