												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://bit.ly/40azDcV" target="_blank">https://bit.ly/40azDcV</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>In the context of the new Fintech Law, we will be participating in the “Fintech Law in Chile: Local Regulations and Opportunities for Foreigners” webinar, to be held on April 25. The activity will discuss important issues such as the definition, implementation and projections of the new law, as well as the opportunities it represents [&hellip;]</p>

