											<p>A Chile-Australia Business Council activity will be held on April 24, attended by an important delegation of high-level Australian and Chilean businesspersons connected, in particular, with mining and service providers. The event will strengthen the ties of cooperation and association in a productive sector of enormous importance for the economies of both countries. The executive [&hellip;]</p>

