											<p>Latin America’s largest mining fair has become a space for promoting sharing knowledge, experiences, and especially technology that contributes to innovation and increased productivity in mining processes. All of these make it a great platform that showcases global opportunities here in Chile. With a track record spanning some 30 years and 15 previous versions, it [&hellip;]</p>

