											</div>
											<p>In the context of the Chile Image Meeting 2023, the Director of InvestChile, Karla Flores, will participate in the panel &#8211; Positioning Chile in the world: a transversal, diverse and collaborative strategy; together with Verónica Pardo, Undersecretary of Tourism; Ignacio Fernández, Director of ProChile. Registration at: https://encuentroimagendechile.cl/ </p>

