											</div>
											<p>The Embassy of Chile in Germany, together with the Ministry of Energy and InvestChile-the Foreign Investment Promotion Agency-,organize a business breakfast and dialogue  with the Chilean Energy Minister, Mr. Diego Pardow, to discussin detail the government strategy and policies on energy transition to tackle climate change, and to explore the emerging investment opportunities in this [&hellip;]</p>

