												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://startupole.eu/chile/" target="_blank">https://startupole.eu/chile/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>STARTUP OLÉ is organizing their 5th Roadshow in digital format, following the success of previous versions. Its aim is to connect Chile with European corporations, investors, accelerators, governments and media, opening an exclusive door to Europe and the international market. InvestChile will be participating as a sponsor of the event.</p>

