											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is to take part in the IDB workshop on FDI promotion agencies, monitoring, evaluation and sustainability. The activity will take place in Washington DC between March 1 and 2. InvestChile Director Karla Flores will present on the agency’s indicators, results and impact. The Director will also meet with InvestChile’s investment commissioner for North America, [&hellip;]</p>

