											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is organizing its 6th International Investment Forum 2022, which will present emerging investment opportunities and Chile’s new economic strategies and FDI policies. The event will be held on December 5,6 and 7 and will offer a range of opportunities for gaining an overall view of the investment climate in Chile. The Forum will be [&hellip;]</p>

