											</div>
											<p>Fundación Chile España [the Chile-Spain Foundation] and mutual benefit organization Caja Los Andes have organized “Hangar 360 | International Innovation and Entrepreneurship Forum: Chile and Spain, platforms for startup internationalization”, an event that will be held on November 29 at Centro Parque in Santiago, Chile, bringing together leading players in the innovation and entrepreneurship ecosystem, [&hellip;]</p>

