											<p>The Cámara de Comercio e Industrias, Servicios y Turismo de Osorno (Osorno Chamber of Commerce and Industries, Services and Tourism), together with Fundación Chile-España (Chile-Spain Foundation), are organizing the second version of the Chile-Spain Business Forum “New Models of Cooperation and Investment for the Development of Sustainable Business in Southern Chile.” The forum will promote [&hellip;]</p>

