											</div>
											<p>The Tourism Undersecretary’s Office is holding the second version of the ‘Tourism Investment Forum Chile 2022’ this year, a national event that aims to attract investment in the sector and connect with the ecosystem. The activity will take place in a hybrid format on Thursday, November 17, at the Mandarin Oriental Hotel. InvestChile Executive Director [&hellip;]</p>

