											<p> Launch event for the Technological Transformation Process for Regional Public Transport Systems. Organized by the Regional Public Transport Division together with InvestChile, Transport and Telecommunications Minister Juan Carlos Muñoz and InvestChile Executive Director Karla Flores will be participating. The Request for Information to implement electronic payment systems throughout Chile will also be announced at the [&hellip;]</p>

