												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>This year’s annual Japan-Chile Business Committee meeting coincides with the 125th anniversary of officially established diplomatic relations between the two countries. On this occasion, the meeting takes place against a backdrop of various societal issues and challenges that require global action, including economic resilience, geopolitical shifts, modernization of agriculture, automation, robotization, and, in particular, the [&hellip;]</p>

