												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 09-11-2022 5:00 pm</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://bit.ly/3fy0gai" target="_blank">https://bit.ly/3fy0gai</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>A networking event will be held as part of the ‘Dutch Hydrogen Fair’, the Dutch trade mission with a focus on green hydrogen that will take place on November 9 at 5PM. The event will allow Dutch companies and organizations to share their experiences, as well as offer opportunities to companies already established in Chile. [&hellip;]</p>

