											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 09-11-2022 10:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Santa Rosa de Apoquindo, Santiago, Chile.</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://lp.startupslatam.com/startups-latam-fest-2022/" target="_blank">https://lp.startupslatam.com/startups-latam-fest-2022/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Startups Latam Fest; the content hub of Latam is the initiative that seeks to grow the entrepreneurship community; sharing, collaborating, connecting stories of the startup world and making emerging entrepreneurs visible, attracting investment and generating networks for their development in Latin America and the world. InvestChile will sponsor the event. &nbsp;</p>

