											<p>ACTE will be the first fair to bring to together Chile&#8217;s audiovisual industry with professionals and businesses from Chile and abroad in order to promote, market and boost the industry in Chile. The main objective of the event is to enhance Chile’s country image and promote it as a film location for the audiovisual market. [&hellip;]</p>

