											<p>‘Coffee meeting with “A look at the factors to support digital transformation in Chile, focusing on infrastructure, trends and challenges”’ will be held this Friday, October 28. The event has been organized by DRS Ingeniería y Gestión and sponsored by InvestChile. Its goal is to share topics of high interest to professionals from various areas. [&hellip;]</p>

