											</div>
											<p>The two-day event is positioned as an open meeting space for actors from the innovation ecosystems of Chile and the US. It is a great opportunity to listen to top leaders, and experts talk about the latest trends to promote fertile collaboration, exchange of skills, and the development of high-value business and technological ventures. On [&hellip;]</p>

