											</div>
											<p>EDIFICA is the most important construction fair in Latin America that brings together suppliers, professional visitors and representatives of the public and private sectors. The exhibition is organized by the Chilean Chamber of Construction (CChC) and co-organized by FISA. InvestChile will be participating as a sponsor in this event with the purpose to promote the [&hellip;]</p>

