											<p>On Tuesday, September 6, a workshop will take place with foreign companies that are InvestChile clients. The event will include a presentation of the Talento Digital training program for the employees of companies that export ITO services. InvestChile is a co-organizer of the event and Vanessa Severin, Coordinator Investor Relations, will participate as a speaker. [&hellip;]</p>

