											<p>Expo Hospital is the main event in Chile for the health sector that offers all the solutions to face the challenges of the industry. The multi-sector exhibition allows professionals and health teams responsible for the areas of management, supply, logistics, care and patient care in the public sector and private to find the latest trends [&hellip;]</p>

