											<p>With more than 776 electric buses, Santiago de Chile has the world’s largest green public transit fleet, second only to China’s cities. This scenario has paved the way for the upcoming gathering, Latam Mobility: Chile 2022, which will bring together the nation&#8217;s public and private sectors to channel efforts to enable the country to fulfill [&hellip;]</p>

