											</div>
											<p>The Let’s Reactivate Ñuble Business Meeting is scheduled to take place on Friday, August 19. The event is intended to open up opportunities for public-private dialogue and agreement and to reveal the Government’s foreign trade agenda and initiatives that could help companies in the Ñuble Region with their international expansion processes, among other things. InvestChile [&hellip;]</p>

