											</div>
											<p>The Chilean Medical Device Association (ADIMECH) – comprised of 14 medical device companies that import technology designed to support patient health through health care innovation – will meet at 3 pm on Wednesday, August 10, 2022. InvestChile Director Karla Flores will present at the event on InvestChile’s vision regarding key aspects of the life sciences [&hellip;]</p>

