											<p>InvestChile is sponsoring the new version of the Explorations and Mines Fair organized by the Colegio de Geólogos Chile, which will be held on August 9, 10 and 11, 2022, in Espacio Riesco, the largest events center in Santiago. With the motto “Exploring the Mines of Tomorrow”, FEXMIN 2022 will gather the Chilean and foreign [&hellip;]</p>

