											<p>Online event with the delegation from Bayern, Germany, where important issues related to the development of H2 in Chile will be raised. Investment Promotion Executive for the Energy Sector at InvestChile, Juan Pablo Purcell, will attend remotely to better understand the challenges of creating a new industry in Chile and to raise policy opportunities to [&hellip;]</p>

