											<p>Given the constant evolution of information technologies, the dynamics of the industry confronts increasing challenges and complexities, &#8211; from conception to development, adoption and technological implementation. The Gartner Tech Growth &amp; Innovation Conference will focus this year on the generation of IT strategies with a customer-centric approach. The event brings together leaders from IT companies [&hellip;]</p>

