											</div>
											<p>The Argentine Software Industry Chamber (CESSI) is the entity gathering and representing 1,800+ companies of the IT sector in Argentina. Through its Foreign Market Development Commission, CESSI promotes the internationalization of its members, seeking to insert them in the most innovative ecosystems in the world. The Webinar Softlanding Chile will offer an overview of the [&hellip;]</p>

