											</div>
											<p>In order to join forces with the agencies involved in attracting investment in tourism, the Tourism Undersecretariat is to sign a resource transfer agreement with InvestChile to develop and continue strengthening the ties and collaborative work between the two institutions, taking account of the importance of InvestChile’s role in promoting, developing and attracting foreign investment [&hellip;]</p>

