											</div>
											<p>‘Latin Pack Chile 2022’ is the Latin American meeting bringing the Chilean and international packaging industry together with the entire value chain related to the world of packaging and packing. InvestChile is a sponsor of the second edition of this international fair, which will be held June 29 through July 1 at Espacio Riesco in [&hellip;]</p>

