											</div>
											<p>The EuroChile Business Foundation is promoting the CONNECTEO Trade Mission to Chile, in which 19 European companies belonging to the European Association of Remote Sensing Companies (EARSC) will be participating. The virtual event seeks to understand Chile&#8217;s advantages and areas of opportunity in the provision of geo-information services derived from Earth observation, with the objective [&hellip;]</p>

