											</div>
											<p>InvestChile Executive Director Karla Flores has the pleasure of inviting you to the digital launch of our “Measure what Matters” program, designed in collaboration with Sistema B. Further details about this important new program will be provided during the launch. The program is aimed at foreign companies so that they can measure their socio-environmental impact [&hellip;]</p>

