											</div>
											<p>The World’s Premier Mineral Exploration &amp; Mining Convention, is one of the largest convention for people, companies and organizations in, or connected with, mineral exploration. This event will be hosted in person in Toronto from June 13-15 and online from June 28-29. InvestChile will be participating with the purpose to promote the business opportunities that [&hellip;]</p>

