											</div>
											<p>The nearshore industry is showing impressive growth in Latin America and the Caribbean, driven by the new balances sought by global delivery centers, triggered by the pandemic and the Russia-Ukraine conflict. In this framework, the Nexus 2022 in-person event, will deploy a series of 50 conferences dedicated to the Global Services industry, allowing to connect [&hellip;]</p>

