											</div>
											<p>The 8th version of the Tourism Investment Forum in Latam, InverTUR,  identifies business trends, shows investment opportunities, and connects to generate new clients and leads. Catalina Pérez, Investment Promotion Executive in charge of the tourism industry, will participate in the &#8220;Invest in Chile&#8221; Panel together with Diego Baeza, Head of the Strategic Planning and Coordination [&hellip;]</p>

