											</div>
											<p>Chile is leading the way in Latin America to develop an advanced &amp; sustainable food industry. It is internationally recognized for its entrepreneurial dynamism, which combined with other attributes, such as location, network &amp; diversity, foster an ideal scenario for new businesses. On this occasion, Investment Promotion Executive at InvestChile, Cristian Sagal will participate as [&hellip;]</p>

