											</div>
											<p>InvestChile Director, Karla Flores Mardones, will present the foreign investment promotion agency’s sixth Public Account by video on Tuesday, May 31, 2022. On this occasion, she will outline the institution&#8217;s key achievements and results in 2021, and its goals for this year. For more information, click here: https://tools.investchile.gob.cl/cuenta-publica-invest-chile-2021</p>

