											</div>
											<p>To commemorate International Clinical Trials Day, which is held on May 20, the Chamber of Pharmaceutical Innovation of Chile has organized a seminar titled “Chile: A biomedical research hub. An achievable dream?”, which will discuss the experience of the United Kingdom and the strategy implemented to strengthen the country&#8217;s innovation ecosystem, enabling it to stand [&hellip;]</p>

