									</div>
																							
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/genero-eng-chi-427x313.png" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>ProChile 2022 Gender Agenda launched</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 13-04-2022 9:30 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Santiago, Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>This coming Wednesday, April 13 will see the launch of the ‘2022 gender agenda’ attended by the Foreign Affairs Minister, International Economic Relations Undersecretary, and Women and Gender Equity Minister. The event will take place between 9.30 and 11.30 am. InvestChile Director, Karla Flores, will also be present. &nbsp; This event is by invitation-only.</p>

