											<p>Launched in 2016, the Global Business Forum LATAM has continued to explore new synergies and expand the scope of economic cooperation between businesses across the GCC, Latin American and Caribbean (LAC) regions. Igniting dialogue between business leaders under the themes of reform, empowerment and growth, GBF LATAM returns in 2022 under the Patronage of His [&hellip;]</p>

