											</div>
											<p>GDC is considered the most relevant gathering event in the videogames industry. The 5-day conference bring together key players of the game community: game designers, game programmers, producers/studio managers and visual artists among others.  InvestChile will be present as part of the Chilean Pavillion (virtual booth), interacting with videogame companies and key stakeholders, promoting Chile [&hellip;]</p>

