											</div>
											<p>The International Economic Relations Undersecretary&#8217;s Office and the Foreign Investment Promotion Agency, InvestChile, invite you to attend the webinar “Foreign investment in Chile: Evaluation of the impacts of sustainable investment &#8211; preliminary OECD results.” The event will look at how Chile can attract more FDI and enhance its contribution towards meeting the sustainable development goals, [&hellip;]</p>

