											<p>AquaSur is the largest aquaculture fair in the southern hemisphere and an excellent platform to promote and strengthen the positioning of your products in the market. InvestChile is sponsoring and will be participating, with the purpose to promote the business opportunities that Chile has available in this sector. Aqua Sur 2022 is already in its [&hellip;]</p>

