												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Chile is leading the way in Latin America to develop an advanced &amp; sustainable food industry. It is internationally recognised for its entrepreneurial dynamism, which combined with other attributes, such as location, network &amp; diversity, foster an ideal scenario for new businesses. Join our webinar to discuss what the future of the AgTech industry looks [&hellip;]</p>

