									</div>
																							
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/chile-china-eng-chipng-427x313.png" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>CHINA&#038;CHILE SEMINAR: OPPORTUNITIES AND CHALLENGES FOR DEVELOPING CSP</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 11-01-2022 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://bit.ly/3qcQa1e" target="_blank">https://bit.ly/3qcQa1e</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>In this activity, experts will be exploring the opportunities that concentrated solar power (CSP) development offers in Chile and the contribution China can make thanks to its project development experience. The event will be transmitted via live streaming from 9 am. Prior registration required. The Head of InvestChile’s Investment Promotion Team, Salvatore Di Giovanni, will [&hellip;]</p>

