										<div class="mes-evento">
											<h3>December 2021</h3>
										</div>
									
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/talento-eng-chi-1-427x313.png" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Digital Talent in the Workforce</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 14-12-2021 9:30 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The public-private initiative Digital Talent for Chile, together with InvestChile, Chile’s Foreign Investment Promotion Agency, are organizing this discussion with the aim of analyzing the challenges, advances and opportunities of encouraging “upskilling” or improvement of skills and competencies, geared towards the world of data, in the context of the increasing need for digital human capital. [&hellip;]</p>

