											<h4>Green Hydrogen and Mining: Franco-Chilean Dialogue on ESG Challenges</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 10-12-2021 11:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://bit.ly/3cJy5jR" target="_blank">https://bit.ly/3cJy5jR</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>In light of the 21st version of French Week 2021 in Chile, the Franco-Chilean Chamber of Commerce and Industry, together with the Sustainable Development Club, would like to invite you to a webinar on December 10th at 11:00 am:  “Green Hydrogen and Mining: Franco-Chilean Dialogue on ESG Challenges”. The event is sponsored by InvestChile and [&hellip;]</p>

