												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://bit.ly/3EhyLZC" target="_blank">https://bit.ly/3EhyLZC</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Digital Talent, together with InvestChile, are organizing a virtual event called “New Digital Talent for Chile and the World,” at 10 am on December 7. This activity includes the launch of a platform through which you can access the Digital Talent for Chile pool of graduates. The event will also address Chile’s potential as a [&hellip;]</p>

