										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Chile Week China</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 25-11-2021 9:30 pm</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Investment and business opportunities roadshow in China to promote Chile as a destination for doing business and investing in Latin America. The roadshow will run from November 25 through December 3, 2021. The schedule will include a seminar in Beijing attended by InvestChile&#8217;s Investment Commissioner for Asia, Vicente Pinto, and Energy Undersecretary Francisco López. Meanwhile, [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/chile-week-china/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
