											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/puc-peru-eng-chi-427x313.png" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Conference cycle: Invest and Sell Internationally</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 18-11-2021 12:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.pucp.edu.pe/" target="_blank">https://www.pucp.edu.pe/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>International conference organized by the Pontificia Universidad Católica del Perú, where institutions, embassies and chambers of commerce will briefly present their work. Investment Promotion Executive Javier González will speak on behalf of InvestChile about why it is worth investing in Chile.</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/conference-cycle-invest-and-sell-internationally/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
