											</div>
											<p>The China-LAC Business Summit is an official economic-trade event that forms part of the China-CELAC Forum, and has been recognized as a flagship brand in China-LAC practical cooperation. The summit occurs annually with one edition in China and another in a LAC country. This year it will take place on November 16 and 17. Chile’s [&hellip;]</p>

