											<p>Softex is the trade association for Brazilian software companies. In “Missão Chile” a virtual delegation of 20 Brazilian software companies will take part in a range of workshops with presentations from trade associations and different private and public sector agencies (such as InvestChile and StartUpChile). The event will take place between November 16 and 18.  InvestChile has [&hellip;]</p>

