											<p>Araucanía Regional Governor Luciano Rivas Stepke and the Regional Foreign Investment Promotion and Attraction Unit, InvestAraucanía, invite you to participate in the workshop: “Invest in Chile’s Araucanía Region: Challenges and opportunities for foreign investment attraction.” It will take place on October 27 at 9.30 a.m. in the Alto Portales event center in Temuco. The activity [&hellip;]</p>

