											<p>SeguridadExpo is the main event of the sector in Chile, because it offers solutions to face the security challenges in the country. This exhibition, which is international, had in its 2019 version broad institutional support from both the government and the private sector, more than 130 exhibitors participated and received more than 4,000 visitors. During [&hellip;]</p>

