										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Chile on Board: A virtual conversation with Juan Carlos Jobet, chilean Minister of Energy and Mines</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 25-10-2021 2:00 pm</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>In partnership with ProChile, AS/COA will host the Chilean Minister of Energy and Mines, Juan Carlos Jobet, for a virtual conversation. He will discuss the Chilean National Green Hydrogen Strategy, and the key milestones under execution for the country to become a world leading producer and exporter of green H2. *Events by invitation only. &nbsp;</p>

