											</div>
											<p>The activity “International Experiences with Investment Contracts and Legal Stability Clauses” will be held on Tuesday, October 19 at 17:00 hours. It will focus on international experience of legal clauses for investment stability, how they have evolved and the consequences that they have had for countries. The experiences of countries in the region, such as [&hellip;]</p>

