											</div>
											<p>The Faculty of Administration, Finance and Business at the Universidad SEK is organizing a seminar on October 19 starting at 10 am, called The New Wave of Chinese Investment in Chile: Challenges and Opportunities. The online event will include the participation of former President Eduardo Frei, among other distinguished guests. On this occasion, InvestChile Managing [&hellip;]</p>

