											<p>The Gartner IT Symposium / Xpo has become one of the most important events for CIOs and IT executives, being a meeting place and a space for reflection on topics such as digital business acceleration, Artificial Intelligence, cybersecurity, the future of work, blockchain and trends in disruptive technologies, among others. The 2021 conference, which will [&hellip;]</p>

