											<p>InvestChile is a strategic partner of the Scale VC program, a cycle of activities being organized by Endeavor between July and September. The purpose of this initiative is to connect family offices and venture capital funds in Chile with international role models to share best practice and boost the entrepreneurial ecosystem. This is a priority niche for InvestChile [&hellip;]</p>

