											</div>
											<p>The Gartner event will focus on accelerating growth in a new era of transformation, becoming a post-pandemic guide on how to thrive and manage high growth in the technology services sector. The conference will address technology trends that are impacting business, provide tools to navigate and adapt in an era of disruption and uncertainty, as [&hellip;]</p>

