											<p>The GDC international conference is considered one of the most relevant events in the videogame field, gathering key players of the industry: videogame developers, programmers, producers, visual artists as well as hardware, software, middleware and service providers. InvestChile will be taking part with a virtual stand, as part of ProChile’s Chilean Pavilion. From there, it [&hellip;]</p>

