											</div>
											<p>The Committee of Ministers for the Promotion and Attraction of Foreign Investment is to meet for the second time this year, bringing together the following ministers: Economy, Finance, Foreign Affairs, Public Works, Mining, Energy and Agriculture. They will review the status of foreign direct investment in Chile and Latin America,  fine tune the final details [&hellip;]</p>

