											</div>
											<p>The Official Spanish Chamber of Commerce in Chile (CAMACOES) is holding an event to launch the “CAMACOES business platform” on June 30, 2021. This will be a virtual platform featuring both companies already set up in Chile and firms that are members of chambers of commerce of different Spanish communities. InvestChile Managing Director Andrés Rodríguez [&hellip;]</p>

