											</div>
											<p>The Investment Link program&#8217;s first meeting will gather Ambassadors and Commercial Attachés from the countries included in this experience. This initiative, promoted by ProChile and InvestChile, aims to attract more and better foreign investment to our country. The activity will take place on Wednesday, June 30, at 10:00 AM (Chilean time).</p>

