											<h4>Bridge or Destination? LNG &#038; Hydrogen In the Energy Transition</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 29-06-2021 4:00 pm</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://cutt.ly/hmq1fRy" target="_blank">https://cutt.ly/hmq1fRy</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The increasing prominence of sustainability on the global agenda has led to increased momentum to decarbonize our energy systems. Part of the Singapore International Energy Week activities is SIEW Energy Insights &#8211; Webinar Series panels, in which our investment commissioner for Japan and Asia, Vicente Pinto, will present the opportunities and challenges of hydrogen and [&hellip;]</p>

