											</div>
											<p>Under the theme “Reinvest in the Americas”, the event organized by the Inter-American Development Bank (IDB) and the ConnectAmericas business platform will be a virtual business matchmaking event that brings together global corporations, SMEs, entrepreneurs and governments from more than 30 countries in Latin America and the Caribbean (LAC). The event gives companies and participating [&hellip;]</p>

