											<p>A webinar organized by the France-Chile Chamber of Commerce, the Embassy of France in Chile, the Sustainable Development Club in Chile, ProChile and MEDEF international and sponsored by InvestChile. The event will review the prospects and challenges facing French companies in relation to green hydrogen in Chile. Scheduled for Tuesday, June 22 between 9:00 and [&hellip;]</p>

