											</div>
											<p>Next week, the Director of InvestChile, Andrés Rodríguez, will present a report on the agency’s actions in 2020 and its guiding principles and challenges for 2021. This report will be published on the agency’s official website (www.investchile.gob.cl) at 3pm next Friday, May 28.</p>

