											<p>The second version of the LatAm Blockchain Forum will bring together the main global companies, regional companies and public bodies that are leading the promotion of blockchain development in Latin America. The event will highlight the opportunities for blockchain use in different industries, such as financial services, health, energy and retail, amongst others. The event [&hellip;]</p>

