											</div>
											<p>Green hydrogen is becoming a key enabler for the decarbonization of various industries such as transportation and mining. In this context, Chile has unique assets – its resources for the extremely creative and competitive production of renewable energy. Norway, Chile’s potential collaborator in this technology, is known to be at the forefront of the design [&hellip;]</p>

