											<p>InvestChile is sponsoring the new version of FEXMIN, the Explorations and Mines Fair organized by the College of Geologists of Chile, will be held on May 25, 26, and 27, 2021. This third version will be virtual, after two postponements due to the pandemic. The main objective is to offer a meeting place that allows [&hellip;]</p>

