											</div>
											<p>The Cannon is a company based in Houston, Texas (USA) that supplies “innovation infrastructure”, operating a network of coworking spaces and innovation hubs focused on developing a community of entrepreneurs, startups, investors and corporate innovators. The organization holds an annual series of events in a “Doing Business” format to explore opportunities for international cooperation, which [&hellip;]</p>

