											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is sponsoring this webinar organized by the French-Chilean Chamber of Commerce in conjunction with the Women and Gender Equity Minister.  At this event, the Minister and French companies that are members of the Chamber will share best practice, and the Diversity &amp; Inclusion Circle will be launched in the French-Chilean Chamber of Commerce.</p>

