											<p>InvestChie is sponsoring the event ‘FinTech in 2021, a great opportunity for economic reactivation’, organized by the CCI-Franco-Chilean Chamber of Commerce and The Start Up Club. On the occasion, the following topics will be revised: Map of FinTech in Chile and its 2021 challenges How FinTech revolutionizes the Financial Industry The imperative of being Green [&hellip;]</p>

