											<p>InvestChile is sponsoring the first Latin American technical and technological exchange event &#8220;Expo Hydrogen Patagonia 2021&#8221;.  In its first version the event will be virtual, including more than 28 presentations and 20 stands, through an interactive platform that allows establishing business links and collaboration between companies and relevant institutions for the green hydrogen value chain.</p>

