											</div>
											<p>The aim of transferring new technologies and generating links between different markets in the region for the Health Industry, the HealthTech Latam 2021 meeting will be held, an event promoted by the Chiletec trade association, with the support of ProChile and the collaboration of Cens and ACHAlliance . Health Tech Latam 2021 will be a [&hellip;]</p>

