												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual event</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.camarafrancochilena.cl/" target="_blank">https://www.camarafrancochilena.cl/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Conversation with InvestChile, the Foreign Investment Promotion Agency, to learn about the concerns of the member companies of the Chilean Free Chamber, and their plans and/or topics of interest for this year. InvestChile will present its support services for established companies and the ongoing and planned initiatives this year.</p>

