											<p>This meeting aims to have a conversation in a &#8220;live&#8221; format addressing how we can take advantage of the experience in technology and markets that China has today, considered the great laboratory for the digital economy of the 21st century. InvestChile will participate as a panelist in the meeting. PROGRAM 10: 00– 10:05 Welcome-Marcel Oppliger, [&hellip;]</p>

