											</div>
											<p>The Chinese cultural week in the framework of the Spring Festival 2021&#8217;s celebration is organized by the Confucius Institute of the Universidad de la Frontera.  InvestChile will participate in the Economy and Business conference between China and Chile, presenting on Chinese investment in Chile. PROGRAM -Opening video -Introduction (Paola Olave, Academic Director of the Confucius [&hellip;]</p>

