											</div>
											<p>The coronavirus pandemic has highlighted the need for a public-private relationship for economic recovery. The pandemic is having severe consequences on the Spanish economy and in Latin America, which will require strong actions in economic policy that guarantee the resilience of the region for the future. It is our talk with the main investment agencies [&hellip;]</p>

