											<h4>Connecting the Connectivities: Synergy through enhanced partnership</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 22-01-2021 6:00 am</span>
