											<p>As Latin America grapples with the devastating economic and social effects caused by Covid-19, relations with Japan, the world&#8217;s third-largest economy, one of the main foreign investors in many of the region&#8217;s strategic industries, and partner to a significant number of companies operating throughout Latin America,   could do a lot to improve recovery prospects. Our [&hellip;]</p>

