											</div>
											<p>Investchile Japan and the Japan Institute for Overseas Investment (JOI) together with Interamerican Development Bank (IDB) are pleased to invite you to a virtual Business Seminar on November 26th, between 9:00 and 11:00 am. Japan is a key player in the development of the Green Hydrogen Economy. Chile is a natural laboratory for the energy [&hellip;]</p>

