												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://tools.investchile.gob.cl/e-seminar2020" target="_blank">https://tools.investchile.gob.cl/e-seminar2020</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>What are the challenges for the global economy in the post-pandemic world? Today, more than ever, innovative entrepreneurship and sustainable foreign investment are key for the reactivation of local economies. Chile, as a key Latin American foreign investment hub, is committed to strengthening this path. Here, we would like to invite you to discuss and [&hellip;]</p>

