											</div>
											<p>This event organized under the 50 years of diplomatic relations between Chile and China, organized by the Confucius Institute of the Pontificia Universidad Católica de Chile, along with the Embassy of Chile in China and the Chinese Embassy in Chile. It is about a week of activities that will have as main themes: Economy, diplomacy, [&hellip;]</p>

