											</div>
											<p>InvestChile invites you to a new #InvestChileTalk series&#8217; virtual event. In this opportunity, along with the Minister of Economy, Lucas Palaciones, the following topics will be addressed.  Topics:World economic panorama and investment in ChileEconomic context and country situationReactivation measuresMedium-term prospectsInvestor services and business facilitationDigital transformation to reactivate  </p>

