											<p>Sergio Giacaman García Biobío Region&#8217; major  and Juan Araya Allende, InvestChile&#8217;s acting director, are pleased to invite you to the signing ceremony of the Collaboration Agreement between the two institutions In order to commit and cooperate with InvestChile&#8217;s know-how and showcase the joint effort in the positioning, promotion and attraction of Foreign Direct Investment. This [&hellip;]</p>

