											</div>
											<p>The main event of the Shared Services and Outsourcing industry &#8211; SSOW- this year will be held in a fully digital format. The event brings together senior executives in charge of North American Shared Service Centers (SSC) and BPOs along with recognized leaders and more than 50 experts. They will analyze industry trends and discuss [&hellip;]</p>

