										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Webinar |  How did the social and health crisis impact M&#038;A investments in the 1st semester and what to expect for the 2nd?</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 21-08-2020 9:30 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Virtual Event </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://deloitte.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_is1DqacwRAiELe24YZnRnQ" target="_blank">https://deloitte.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_is1DqacwRAiELe24YZnRnQ</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The Webinar will present M&amp;A trends in the first half of 2020 and prospects for the future. It will be made in a flexible and pleasant round table. InvestChile will share the recent Chinese investment evolution in Chile,  its vision, expectations, and projections about Chinese companies in Chile.  </p>

