											<p>InvestChile is collaborating with Imagen de Chile on the upcoming webinar, ‘What makes a country &#8220;good&#8221;? Chile’s potential role in today&#8217;s world context&#8217;, to be held this Friday, 14th of August, at 12:00 hours, via live streaming. During the event, the British specialist Simon Anholt will be the keynote speaker. The purpose of the activity [&hellip;]</p>

