											<p>InvestChile, as the Investment Promotion Agency, will share with  Portuguese companies the investment opportunities for their prospects in the Chilean market. The event is organized by Chile&#8217;s Portugal Chamber of Commerce and is part of the activities to boost the economy especially between the two countries. Speakers:  Cristián Sagal –  Investment Promotion Executive. Pedro Magalhaes [&hellip;]</p>

