											</div>
											<p>InvestChile&#8217;s director (s) Juan Araya Allende,  invites you to join us in a new chapter of the #InvestChileTalks series of events. This time the topics will be the following:  Speaker:  Andrés Pérez M. Head of Advisors and Coordinator of International Finance, Ministry of Finance. Topics: -Context and health situation-Economic policy response-Recent performance of the economy-Medium-term [&hellip;]</p>

