											</div>
											<p>The webinar is organized by the Turkish Business Association (DEIK), the Turkish Construction Companies Association (TMB), the Chilean Ministry of Public Works and ProChile Turkey, in collaboration with InvestChile.  The goal of this online event is to promote MOP&#8217;s portfolio of public projects to the years 2020-2024, and thus allowing the participation of foreign companies [&hellip;]</p>

