											</div>
											<p>Cristián Rodríguez Chiffelle, InvestChile director, will present at the next webinar &#8220;Tax modernization and economic measures of the government to face the COVID-19 crisis&#8221;, to be held next Monday, May 4, from 9:30 am. The presentation will be given by Manuel Alcalde, Tax Policy Coordinator of the Ministry of Finance, along with Manuel Tomás Kovacevic, [&hellip;]</p>

