											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 30-04-2020 10:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Online </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.bigmarker.com/investchile1/Nuevas-formas-de-trabajar-y-legislaci-n-laboral-lo-que-las-empresas-deben-saber?show_live_page=true" target="_blank">https://www.bigmarker.com/investchile1/Nuevas-formas-de-trabajar-y-legislaci-n-laboral-lo-que-las-empresas-deben-saber?show_live_page=true</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>#InvestChileTalks is part of InvestChile&#8217;s Series of Webinars. In this opportunity, the activity will seek to review the legal aspects of the new labor legislation, with an emphasis on its practical application, and to review those Home Office aspects that should be considered in this framework. More information on the link above.</p>

