											<p>InvestChile is going to attend to the The World’s Premier Mineral Exploration &amp; Mining Convention, one of the largest convention for people, companies and organizations in, or connected with, mineral exploration. In addition to meeting over 1,100 exhibitors, 2,500 investors and 25,800 attendees from 132 countries, the possiblity to attend technical sessions, short courses and [&hellip;]</p>

