												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Prochile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.pdac.ca/convention" target="_blank">https://www.pdac.ca/convention</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The Mining Minister, Baldo Prokurica, and the director of InvestChile, Cristián Rodríguez, will participate  in the launch of PDAC 2020, along with other government officials and representatives of the sector’s companies. The four-day Canadian trade show will have over 1,100 exhibitors and be visited by 25,000 people.</p>

