										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Corfo calls specialized lithium producers to invest in Chile</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 20-01-2020 12:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Corfo calls on Specialized Producers from all over the world to develop a new industry in the country, profitable and exportable to the globe. Corfo, the Chilean Economic Development Agency, calls on Specialized Producers from all over the world to show their interest in developing capacities in Chile to produce lithium derived materials with a preferential.</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/corfo-llama-a-productores-especializados-de-litio-a-invertir-en-chile/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
