											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 16-01-2020 12:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Minister of Economy, Economic Development and Tourism,  Salón Blanco </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/minister-palacios-chairs-meeting-of-committee-of-ministers-for-the-promotion-and-attraction-of-foreign-investment/" target="_blank">https://www.investchile.gob.cl/minister-palacios-chairs-meeting-of-committee-of-ministers-for-the-promotion-and-attraction-of-foreign-investment/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>During the meeting, the director of InvestChile, Cristián Rodríguez, will report on the Agency’s principal activities in 2019.T he meeting will informed about the main aspects of InvestChile’s proposed new strategy, including the elimination of specific sectors and a shift to a criterion of inter-sector work with projects that help to create permanent jobs and [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/committee-of-ministers-for-the-promotion-and-attraction-of-foreign-investment/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
