										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Meeting at the Embassy of Spain&#8217;s Residence</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 14-01-2020 12:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Residencia Embajada de España </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://www.camacoes.cl/" target="_blank">http://www.camacoes.cl/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The Embassy of Spain&#8217;s residency will open its doors to the Minister of Economy, Lucas Palacios, InvestChile&#8217;s director, Cristián Rodriguez C.  for a breakfast meeting that will be chaired by the Ambassador of Spain, Enrique Ojeda Vila. The main goal of the event, organized by CAMACOES and InvestChile  is to create a dialogue with representatives [&hellip;]</p>

