											<p>The Advantage Austria&#8217;s Director, Drazen Maloca and the Austrian Ambassador in Chile, Joachim Öppinger, have invited InvestChile&#8217;s Director, Cristián Rodríguez Chiffelle, to participate at the  celebration of  the Energy Globe Awards. The ENERGY GLOBE Award was founded in 1999 and  is one of today’s most prestigious environmental awards. The main Goal of the Award is to [&hellip;]</p>

