											</div>
											<p>InvestChile, the government agency responsible for promoting Chile in the global market as a destination for foreign direct investment,  invites private and public authorities to be part of the second session of the Public and Private Advisory Council. It will be lead by the Minister of Economy, Development and Tourism, Lucas Palacios, and will aim [&hellip;]</p>

