											</div>
											<p>During COP 25, the Government of Chile  invites investors to attend a roundtable to explore perspectives and opportunities for international companies in the Chilean Energy Sector. This activity will be held at IFEMA Convention Centre, Chile pavillion, Blue Zone. Key discussion points:  Overview of the industry Recent regulatory changes Main challenges ahead Challenges and opportunities [&hellip;]</p>

