											<p>The Schneider Electric plant inauguration&#8217;s agenda is the following: 10:00 10:10 Reception of guests 10:10 10:30 Safety First, Welcome, Moving Videos and Virtual Tour 10:30 10:40 EcoStruxure Planta Santiago &#8211; Connectivity System of our IoT devices 10:40 10:50 EPP Plant Tour Preparation 10:50 11:15 Plant Tour 11:15 11:45 Words from Luc, Rafael, Mario, Paulo, Pablo, acknowledgments [&hellip;]</p>

