											</div>
											<p>Cristian Rodriguez Chiffelle,  InvestChile&#8217;s Director, will participate as panelist at the Cambridge Judge Business School (CJBS) will celebrate its 1st Latin American Business Summit (LABS) in Santiago of Chile, next November 3rd-8th. The Program has leaders from different areas and industries, in order to give the attendees a complete introduction to the region (politics, institutional, business, [&hellip;]</p>

