											</div>
											<p>SEG 2019 is the annual congress of the Society of Economic Geologists. This year’s conference will focus on the metallogeny of deposits throughout South America, along with new discoveries and technical discussions on geometallurgy. A wide range of activities is planned to complement an array of technical presentations. InvestChile will be present to make contact [&hellip;]</p>

