										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Anuga</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 05-10-2019 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Cologne, Germany </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.anuga.com/" target="_blank">https://www.anuga.com/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Anuga is the world&#8217;s leading food &amp; beverage fair for the retail trade and the food service, which takes place every two years in Cologne, Germany. As the world&#8217;s most important food and beverage trade fair InvestChile will attend to meet the biggest companies with interest to expand their business to Chile in this sector [&hellip;]</p>

