											<p>IT industry conference focused on technology service providers, that will gather 800 IT world counterparts.  The conference seeks to explain how IT markets are changing, analyze trends, expose the competitive environment, reveal opportunities for growth and areas in decline, generate a critical look at emerging technologies, including: Cloud, Artificial Intelligence (AI), Edge Computing, Blockchain, Automation [&hellip;]</p>

