											<p>InvestChile sponsors Expo Wine + Beer 2019, a fair that gathers together more than 300 exhibitors and 10,000 participants between producers and suppliers of vineyards and breweries. The event includes a wine conference and business roundtables for national and foreign businesspeople, including owners, managers of vineyards and breweries, winemakers, warehouse and plant managers, commercial and [&hellip;]</p>

