											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 23-05-2019 10:30 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Ricardo Lyon, 222, 3rd floor</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://trade.ec.europa.eu/tradehelp/" target="_blank">https://trade.ec.europa.eu/tradehelp/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile&#8217;s director Cristían Rodríguez Chiffelle, will participate as a keynote speaker at the Meeting of Economic and Commercial Advisers of European Union Embassies in Chile, on May 23rd.  European diplomats are keen to hear about Investchile&#8217;s activities, in order to better inform their commercial offices and their companies that wish to invest in the country.</p>

