											<p>Gartner, one of the most respected IT consultancy and research companies, is holding a regional summit on strategy issues for the digital era, including cloud computing, IoT, AI, automation, machine learning and trends in the IT sector. The summit, which will take place on April 24-25 in Sao Paulo, will provide an opportunity to interact [&hellip;]</p>

