											<p>Invest Chile&#8217;s director  will participate as guest speaker at the &#8220;Chile Mass Day 2019&#8221; in Boston, about the The Future of Clean Technologies and Advanced Manufacturing. The event begins with a 2-hour tour that will cover the main innovation milestones between Harvard and MIT. The agenda for April 9 will be composed of discussion panels [&hellip;]</p>

