												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> ICON Hotel, 6050 Alonso de Córdova Ave.  Las Condes, Santiago, Chile.</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.latamweforum.com/" target="_blank">https://www.latamweforum.com/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The LATAM Women Empowerment Forum 2019 seeks to draw attention to the women leaders in Latin America who inspire power, the companies and governments that are supporting the development of diversity and workplace inclusion through new technologies and political progress and those empowered women who are leading their development in the region. InvestChile is a [&hellip;]</p>

