											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/ocde427-chica-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>The OECD Latin America and the Caribbean Investment Iniciative Meeting</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 14-03-2019 1:00 pm</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> OECD Conference Centre, Paris, France </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://www.oecd.org/" target="_blank">http://www.oecd.org/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>At the OECD Latin America and Caribbean Investment Initiative Meeting, the head economist of InvestChile, Karla Flores, will speak about the Agency’s work in the context of the OECD-IDB alliance and the two institutions’ network of Investment Promotion Agencies. The meeting will take place on March 14, at 13:00, in the Conference Center of the [&hellip;]</p>

