											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/oecd-logo-427-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>OECD Dialogue on International Investment Policy</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 11-03-2019 8:45 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> OECD Conference Centre, Paris, France</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://www.oecd.org/fr/investissement/conference-investment-treaties.htm" target="_blank">http://www.oecd.org/fr/investissement/conference-investment-treaties.htm</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The director of InvestChile, Cristián Rodríguez, is participating in discussions about the latest policies and measures that different countries are implementing or hope to implement, either to facilitate investment or protect certain sectors or industries. The OECD Dialogue on International Investment Policy will take place on March 11-12 in Paris, France.</p>

