											<p>The LatAm Blockchain Forum brings together more than 100 attendees from the main global and regional companies leading digital transformation and blockchain innovation applied to industries, as well as the government authorities that drive their development in the region. The event will cover opportunities for use in various industries such as Financial Services, Health, Energy [&hellip;]</p>

