											</div>
											<p>The Ministry of State Properties will be holding a breakfast, “Invest in Chile”, at which it will announce its 2018 program of tenders. The activity forms part of the Territory Week during which over 150 sites, totaling more than 18,000 hectares, will be presented that are available for investment projects in areas such as agriculture, [&hellip;]</p>

