										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Dialogue Series: &#8216;An Inclusive Fourth Industrial Revolution&#8217;</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 26-11-2018 3:00 pm</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Hotel Plaza San Francisco - Salón Rhin. Avenida Libertador Bernardo O´Higgins 816, Santiago. Chile. </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://tools.investchile.gob.cl/dialogueseries" target="_blank">https://tools.investchile.gob.cl/dialogueseries</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The World Economic Forum (WEF) and InvestChile invite you to a talk on “An Inclusive Fourth Industrial Revolution” by Anne Marie Engtoft Larsen, an economist at the WEF and expert on innovation, science, technology and 4IR. The talk is exclusively for public sector leaders in the areas of innovation, technology and productivity. The event will [&hellip;]</p>

