												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://lavca.education/" target="_blank">http://lavca.education/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Training program for investors and fund managers, leveraging the experience of the indstry´s most seasoned executives and deal-makers. Built around case studies of recent transactions and current practices in Latin America. MIT faculty contribute to the curriculum and position the course content in the context of global business and investment trends. Over 80 participants have [&hellip;]</p>

