											</div>
											<p>In a bid to continue consolidating commercial and economic relations with our main trading partner, the fourth version of Chile Week in China &#8211; which will take place this year in the cities of Beijing and Shanghai, between November 1 and 6 &#8211; will include a series of activities to promote products, services and investment [&hellip;]</p>

