											<p>InvestChile and Business Sweden, will hold a breakfast with investors on October 26 in Stockholm, Sweden, as part of the Road Show for Europe which the Foreign Investment Promotion Agency is preparing. The appointment will be attended by the Ambassador of Chile in Sweden, representatives of Business Sweden and ProChile, as well as the Director [&hellip;]</p>

