											<p>SIAL Paris is an event held every two years that seeks to serve as the global showcase for the agribusiness sector, bringing together producers, buyers, distributors and investors around the trends and innovations that will mark the food industry over the coming years. SIAL is now a global network with coverage in North America (Montreal [&hellip;]</p>

