												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="" target="_blank"></a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The acting director of InvestChile, Ian Frederick, will participate in the VII Latin American Investment Forum (LAIF) to be held by the Latin American Trade and Investment Association (LATIA) on October 19 in London, United Kingdom. The event will address different topics having to do with economic relations between the United Kingdom and Latin American [&hellip;]</p>

