												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.lideitalia.org/event/3-america-latina-investment-forum/" target="_blank">https://www.lideitalia.org/event/3-america-latina-investment-forum/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is sponsoring the 3rd version of the Latin American Investment Forum 2018, an event organized by LIDE Italy to promote the region as a strategic investment destination for Italian companies. The results of the “Atlas of Opportunities in Latin America”, prepared by Latin Value Group in collaboration with the region’s economic promotion agencies, will be [&hellip;]</p>

