											</div>
											<p>InvestChile invites key players in the industry to a workshop on Global Services: Trade facilitation and challenges on human capital at which it will talk about its aftercare services and seek to generate public-private collaboration in exploring the challenges of developing a global services industry in Chile. The workshop will take place on Tuesday, October [&hellip;]</p>

