											</div>
											<p>Returning to Tokyo for the fourth consecutive year, the Latin America Japan Investors Forum, organised by Latin Forum, will once again bring together corporate and government leaders from Latin America to discuss the dynamics of the commercial relationship with Japanese companies, financiers and investors. This unique event will feature a range of panel discussions, technical [&hellip;]</p>

