											</div>
											<p>Chile’s Association of Geologists is organizing the second Explorations and Mines Fair, FEXMIN 2018, which will take place in the CasaPiedra Convention Center in Santiago’s Vitacura district on 8-10 October 2018. The Fair, which serves as a meeting place for the different players in the explorations sector and the rest of the mining industry, is [&hellip;]</p>

