											</div>
											<p>InvestChile is sponsoring and will participate in the Industry Forum 4.0 &#8211; Agribusiness, Mining and Logistics &#8211; AMLO 2018, which will take place on Wednesday, October 3, in the SOFOFA Conference Center. During the event, the Director of InvestChile, Ian Frederick, will talk about “Chile: Latin America’s Digital Hub”, referring to the advantages the country [&hellip;]</p>

