											</div>
											<p>The eighth version of the India-Latin America &amp; Caribbean Conclave will be held in Santiago, Chile on 1 and 2 October 2018 at the Ritz-Carlton Hotel. The event is being organized by the Confederation of Indian Industry (CII) – a leader in the diffusion of the “India” Brand &#8211; in association with India’s Ministry of Exterior Affairs [&hellip;]</p>

