											</div>
											<p>The director of InvestChile, Ian Frederick, will give a presentation next Friday 28 September at the second regional conference of the Inter-Pacific Bar Association (IPBA), in the framework of a panel on Investment Opportunities. The meeting will address topics related to the international protection of investment and arbitration, the business climate in the Asia-Pacific, as [&hellip;]</p>

