										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/america-digi2-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>4th America Digital Latin American Congress of Business and Technology</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 05-09-2018 8:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Centro de Convenciones Espacio Riesco, Santiago </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://congreso.america-digital.com/" target="_blank">https://congreso.america-digital.com/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The America Digital Congress serves as a meeting point for authorities, opinion leaders and executives with a focus on Latin American markets. Over 5,000 executives from 22 countries will participate in the event which will include a Digital Exhibition, business roundtables, pavilions and an e-Government Forum. To meet with one of our executives during the [&hellip;]</p>

