										<div class="mes-evento">
											<h3>August 2018</h3>
										</div>
									
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/evento-seeds2-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Seeds of our Future</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 30-08-2018 4:00 pm</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Forager San José (420 S. 1st Street, San Jose, CA)</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://siliconvalleyforum.com/the-seeds-of-our-future-agtech/" target="_blank">https://siliconvalleyforum.com/the-seeds-of-our-future-agtech/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Comprised on an immersion programa and a conference, Silicon Valley Forum’s Seeds of our Future invites global AgTech innovators on a one-week journey through Silicon Valley, San Francisco, and the Central Valley, where they’ll explore sustainable, scalable solutions for the projected population increase in the years to come. During the conference held on August 30th, [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/seeds-of-our-future/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																							
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20304'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/write-593333-1920-1-e1534279450977.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Workshop: Investment Opportunities in the Digital Economy in Chile</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 23-08-2018 11:30 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Conrad Miami, 1395 Brickell Avenue, Miami, Florida. United States.</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/12th-latin-america-shared-services-and-outsourcing-week-ssow/" target="_blank">https://www.investchile.gob.cl/12th-latin-america-shared-services-and-outsourcing-week-ssow/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Chile has become a leading country in Digital Businesses in Latin America, through a solid technological infrastructure and high qualified IT human capital. More than 60 Multinationals have chosen Chile for their Global Services, and we want to share all the knowledge and tools at this workshop so more companies join them. The event, which [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/workshop-investment-opportunities-in-the-digital-economy-in-chile/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																							
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
