											</div>
											<p>Brazil is a key economic and trading partner for Chile and, in 2016, was its fifth largest source of foreign investment. The seminar, organized by InvestChile and FIESP, in collaboration with the Chilean Embassy in Brazil, ProChile and the bilateral Chambers of Commerce of the two countries, will include talks about Chile’s business climate and [&hellip;]</p>

