											</div>
											<p>Fi South America (FiSA) is the only event in Latin America focusing on food ingredients and is one of the most important events internationally for the food and beverages industry. In its 22nd version, FiSA will bring together over 700 brands and 9,052 highly qualified local (Brazilian) and international professionals from 45 countries. It will [&hellip;]</p>

