											</div>
											<p>The Latin American version of the SSOW forms part of a series of events in different regions of the world that seek to foster the incorporation of best practices and technological disruptions (such as RPA and artificial intelligence) by the shared services industry and companies that supply solutions. The event is organized by the Shared [&hellip;]</p>

