											</div>
											<p>On Friday, August 3, InvestChile will hold a breakfast about the V International Investment Forum, which will take place between January 15 and 17, 2019. The breakfast will be chaired by the Minister of Economy, Economic Development and Tourism, José Ramón Valente, and its purpose is to share details of the new version of this [&hellip;]</p>

