												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://nexus2018.com/" target="_blank">http://nexus2018.com/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Nexus 2018 is a two-day conference that explores how to evolve Nearshore relationships in order to meet the demand for ‘greater intelligence” in all facets of service innovation and delivery. In its eighth-annual edition, it will look closely at the requirements of business customers in the age of rapid digital transformation, and the readiness of [&hellip;]</p>

