												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.cebit.de/en/expo/" target="_blank">https://www.cebit.de/en/expo/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>CEBIT 2018 is an event featuring exhibits, conferences and networking, it covers the digitization of business, government and society from every angle. From Tuesday, June 12 until Friday, June 15 it will be the platform for big names in music, artists, and groundbreaking showcases. This is where technology becomes an experience, networking meets street food, [&hellip;]</p>

