											</div>
											<p>Huawei Latin America Core Partner Convention 2018, which will take place on June 4 at 8:00 in Santiago’s Marriott Hotel, will bring together the principal companies in the technology sectors of Chile, Argentina, Peru, Bolivia, Uruguay and Paraguay. The aim of the event, held in Chile for the first time, is to share best practices [&hellip;]</p>

