												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://www.renolit.com/corporate/en/" target="_blank">http://www.renolit.com/corporate/en/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The acting director of InvestChile, Ian Frederick, will attend the inauguration of the new installations of RENOLIT Chile, the group’s first industrial plant in South America. The inauguration will take place on Wednesday, May 30, at 10:00 in the Curauma Industrial Park. RENOLIT is a leading international manufacturer of high-quality plastic films and related products for [&hellip;]</p>

