											<p>During the Hong Kong Business Mission to Santiago, being organized by the Hong Kong Trade Development Council (HKTDC) as part of the visit of its deputy executive director, Raymond Yip, to Chile, the acting director of InvestChile, Ian Frederick, will speak at an information sharing meeting that will take place on May 24 between 10:30 [&hellip;]</p>

