											</div>
											<p>The largest mining tradeshow of Latin America is an established space that promotes transference of knowledge, experiences but especially offers technologies that contribute to the innovation and productivity increase of mining processes, which makes this country´s tradeshow a great platform for worldwide opportunities. Its 15th version brings together all the sectors and has the largest [&hellip;]</p>

