											</div>
											<p>The Annual Conference of the Chile-California Council will take place on April 18-19 in the city of Sacramento, United States. At the event, InvestChile’s investment attaché for North America, Patricia Hansen, will speak about legal aspects of doing business in Chile. Established in 2011, the Chile-California Council (CCC) is a bi-national nonprofit organization that promotes [&hellip;]</p>

