											</div>
											<p>The acting director of InvestChile, Ian Frederick, will be one of the speakers at the First IT Leaders Meeting organized by Wipro, which will take place this Wednesday, April 11 at 8:30. The event, the first of its scale to be held in Chile, will be addressed by numerous IT and programming experts, who will [&hellip;]</p>

