											<h4>Mission of technology companies from Baltic States to visit Chile</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 09-04-2018 8:30 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> NH Collection Plaza</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.eurochile.cl/index.php/es/" target="_blank">https://www.eurochile.cl/index.php/es/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>A delegation of technology companies from Estonia, Latvia and Lithuania will visit Chile between April 8 and 10 in order to learn about the business opportunities the country offers. The visit is organized by the Foreign Ministries of the three Baltic countries, with the support of the EU-LAC Foundation and ELANBiz. The visit will include [&hellip;]</p>

