										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Blockchain: The challenges to come</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 28-03-2018 8:45 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> El Golf 50, Las Condes, Santiago</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://gs1chile.org/" target="_blank">http://gs1chile.org/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>GS1 Chile, the Chilean Corporation for the Development and Administration of Standards, is organizing a Roundtable at which leading speakers will discuss the technology that promises to revolutionize different sectors. The event, in which the director of InvestChile, Carlos Álvarez, will participate, will take place on Wednesday, March 28 between 8:45 and 10:45 in the [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/blockchain-the-challenges-to-come/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
