											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/camion2-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>PDAC &#8211; Prospectors and Developers Association of Canada 2018</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 06-03-2018 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Room #: 206D, Metro Toronto Convention Centre, North Building, Toronto, Canada.</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://www.pdac.ca/" target="_blank">http://www.pdac.ca/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The annual PDAC Convention is regarded as the premier international event for the mineral industry. It has attracted more than 25,000 people from 125 countries in recent years and will next be held on 4-7 March 2018 in Toronto, Canada. The director of InvestChile will participate in a Chile Day Seminar on 6 March when [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/pdac-prospectors-and-developers-association-of-canada-2018/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																																<div class="bloque-eventos">

