											<p>The director of InvestChile, Carlos Álvarez, will be one of the panelists at the China-CELAC Business Forum, an event that will bring together importers, exporters, investors and representatives of bi-national Chambers of Commerce, principally from China. It will also be attended by representatives of the Latin American and Caribbean countries. The aim is to identify [&hellip;]</p>

