											<p>Trends and opportunities for global challenges will be the key topic addressed in the International Seminar “Chile, a World of Services, Exporting your Talent”, organized by the Finance Ministry, InvestChile, the government’s Economic Development Agency (CORFO) and Imagen de Chile. The event, with prominent speakers, will take place on Thursday, January 11, at 9:00 in [&hellip;]</p>

