											<p>Carlos Álvarez, director of InvestChile, will lead a workshop on “Model of Operation for the Promotion, Attraction and Retention of Foreign Direct Investment in Chile’s Regions” to be held in the framework of a consultancy project undertaken for the Agency by Andes Value Research. The meeting’s objective is for public and private players related to [&hellip;]</p>

