											<p>The governor of the Coquimbo Region, Claudio Ibáñez, and the director of InvestChile, Carlos Álvarez, will sign a collaboration agreement to promote foreign investment in the Region. The signing will take place in the framework of the seminar, “Coquimbo Region: A Platform for Investment and Integration”, and the opening of the Agua Negra border crossing [&hellip;]</p>

