											</div>
											<p>The opening of an abroad office of InvestChile marks a very important milestone for Chile, because it means that the country starts to have permanent presence on the destination for FDI promotion and a more direct contact for foreign investors. The expansion of InvestChile through this new office in Frankfurt, a key market for promoting [&hellip;]</p>

