										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>XI China-LAC Business Summit 2017 &#8211; Uruguay</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 30-11-2017 8:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Punta del Este, Uruguay</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://www.chinalac2017.com/home/" target="_blank">http://www.chinalac2017.com/home/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The principal business meeting between China, Latin America and the Caribbean will take place this year in Punta del Este between November 30 and December 2. The China-LAC summit, which will be attended by over 400 Chinese companies as well as authorities from China and around Latin America, is organized by the Chinese Council for [&hellip;]</p>

