											<p>The third version of ChileWeek in China &#8211; which, this year, will take place in the cities of Beijing and Shenzhen and in Hong Kong between August 30 and September 5 &#8211; will include a series of activities to promote products, services and investment in which an important delegation of companies and representatives of the [&hellip;]</p>

