												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/10-key-questions-about-tech-visa/" target="_blank">https://www.investchile.gob.cl/10-key-questions-about-tech-visa/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The official launch and signing of the Visa Tech Protocol will take place on Wednesday, July 19. This public-private initiative seeks to strengthen Chile’s position as a hub of talent and platform for the export of services to the rest of the region, facilitating the attraction of overseas professionals interested in developing projects and/or working for technology [&hellip;]</p>

