												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/roadshow-transantiago-2017/" target="_blank">https://www.investchile.gob.cl/roadshow-transantiago-2017/</a></span>
