											<p>The Ministry of Transport and Telecommunications (MTT) of the Government of Chile and  InvestChile, invite companies operating public transport, and the financial sector around the world to participate in the tender process for the Concession of Road Use of the Public Transport System of Passengers for the City of Santiago – Transantiago (hereinafter Transport System). [&hellip;]</p>

