											<p>The director of InvestChile, Carlos Álvarez, will be a keynote speaker at the LatAm Conference of Geneva Group International (GGI), an event that will take place on June 30 at 9:30 in the Renaissance Hotel, Santiago, Chile. GGI brings together a group of international audit, accounting, law and consulting firms. Its broad international coverage gives [&hellip;]</p>

