											</div>
											<p>As part of the launch of the Program of Promotion of Investment and Technological Development in Mining Suppliers, an Investment Promotion Seminar will take place in the city of Antofagasta on Thursday, June 29. Speakers at the event will include the director of InvestChile, Carlos Álvarez, as well as representatives of CORFO’s Mining Cluster and [&hellip;]</p>

