												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/es/chile-portugal-investment-seminar/" target="_blank">https://www.investchile.gob.cl/es/chile-portugal-investment-seminar/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>A Chile-Portugal Investment Promotion Seminar will take place during the official visit to Chile of a Portuguese delegation led by Prime Minister António Costa. The seminar will include presentations by the principal representatives of InvestChile and AICEP Portugal as well as testimonies of leading Portuguese companies with operations in Chile. InvestChile and AICEP Portugal Global [&hellip;]</p>

