											</div>
											<p>ICEX Spain Trade and Investment and the Economic and Commercial Office of the Spanish Embassy in Chile will hold the Agribusiness Technical Conference Spain-Chile on 5-8 June in Santa Cruz (Region VI) and Santiago. The event will be inaugurated on Tuesday 6 June by the Minister of Agriculture, Carlos Furche, the President of the National [&hellip;]</p>

