											</div>
											<p>Between June 5 and 7, the director of InvestChile, Carlos Álvarez V., will accompany President Michelle Bachelet on her official visit to Toronto (Canada) and Seattle (United States). In both cities, he will meet with local companies, including both those that already have operations in Chile and others that are interested in investing. It is [&hellip;]</p>

