											</div>
											<p>Hosted in different places around the world since 2003, the World Forum for FDI is a prestigious meeting of investment promotion agencies that provides a platform for networking and discussion. The event targets the decision-makers of expanding companies, governments and intermediaries and serves to debate the latest news and trends as regards corporate investment strategies, [&hellip;]</p>

