												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 15-05-2017 8:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Manchester, United Kingdom</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.ssoweek.com/" target="_blank">https://www.ssoweek.com/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile will have a stand for investors at the 17th European Shared Services &amp; Outsourcing Conference, which will take place on May 15-18 in Manchester, United Kingdom. This event brings together the major stakeholders in the global services industry and showcases the principal trends in the sector internationally. Manchester, United Kingdom 15 &#8211; 18 May</p>

