												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://www.eurekanetwork.org" target="_blank">http://www.eurekanetwork.org</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Innovation Week 2017 seeks to facilitate the sharing of know-how and best practices. It includes success stories, keynote speakers and leading exponents of innovation as well as company and institutional stands. EUREKA is a publicly-funded intergovernmental network, involving over 40 countries. Its aim is to enhance European competitiveness by fostering innovation-driven entrepreneurship between small and [&hellip;]</p>

