										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Exponor 2017</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 15-05-2017 12:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Antofagasta, Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://www.exponor.cl" target="_blank">http://www.exponor.cl</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Exponor is an exhibition of technologies and global innovations for the mining industry that takes place each two years in the city of Antofagasta in northern Chile. It is an integral exhibition of the products and services, innovations, advances and improvements that industrial and mining suppliers offer the global market. The fair brings together the [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/exponor-2017/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																							
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/export-day-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Softex Brazil</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 05-05-2017 9:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Sao Paulo, Brazil</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://www.softex.br/internacional/exportday" target="_blank">http://www.softex.br/internacional/exportday</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>InvestChile will participate in Export Day 2017, an event organized by SOFTEX, the Brazilian Association for the Promotion of Software Excellence, and Apex-Brasil. The meeting, held as part of the Brasil IT+ macro project, will take place in São Paulo on May 5. On the same day, the Agency will also participate in bilateral meetings. [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/softex-brazil/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																							
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/Interpack-427-427x313.jpg" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Interpack 2017</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 04-05-2017 12:00 am</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Düsseldorf, Germany</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="http://www.interpack.com/" target="_blank">http://www.interpack.com/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>Interpack is an essential event for the food, beverage, confectionery, bakery, pharmaceutical, cosmetics, non-food and industrial goods sectors. No other trade fair in the world represents the entire supply chain and, at no other trade fair, does the packaging industry provide all industry sectors with tailored solutions and innovative designs based on such a variety of materials. The fair [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/interpack-2017/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																																<div class="bloque-eventos">

										<div class="mes-evento">
											<h3>April 2017</h3>
										</div>
									
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/foro-427x313.png" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>International Investment Forum Chile 2017</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> 03-04-2017 12:00 pm</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Santiago de Chile</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/investment-forum-2017/" target="_blank">https://www.investchile.gob.cl/investment-forum-2017/</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>The International Investment Forum Chile 2017 is a multi-sector summit for senior executives from leading multinational companies that are seeking to position themselves in Chile, one of the world’s leading destinations for the development of investment projects. Participants will hear about numerous investment opportunities in the country and will be able to learn personally about the attractive [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/the-international-investment-forum-chile-2017/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																																<div class="bloque-eventos">

										<div class="mes-evento">
											<h3>January 2026</h3>
										</div>
									
									<div class="item-evento">
										<div class="img-evento">
											<img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20427%20313'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/investlosrios1-427x313.png" />
										</div>
										<div class="contenido-evento">
											<h4>Foro internacional de Inversiones Los Ríos 2017</h4>
											<div class="datos-evento">
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev1.png" /> </span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev2.png" /> Centro de Convenciones Hotel Villa del Río</span>
												<span><img class="lazy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201%201'%3E%3C/svg%3E" data-src="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/wp-content/themes/invest/images/ic-ev3.png" /> <a href="https://www.investlosrios.cl" target="_blank">https://www.investlosrios.cl</a></span>
											</div>
											<p>La Corporación de Desarrollo Productivo de Los Ríos, junto a CORFO e InvestChile, invitan a participar del “Foro Internacional de Inversiones Los Ríos 2017” a realizarse en la Región de Los Ríos entre el 6 y 9 de noviembre de 2017. El propósito de este año es exponer las oportunidades de inversión de impacto en [&hellip;]</p>

																							<a class="btn2 naranjo button button--rayen button--border-thin button--text-thick button--text-upper button--size-s" href="https://www.investchile.gob.cl/foro-internacional-de-inversiones-los-rios-2017/" data-text="view detail"><span>view detail</span></a>
											
										</div>
										<div class="clear"></div>
									</div>
																													
						
								
